Write a program that takes the hourly logs and outputs the prefix sum array representing the cumulative data volume. 
•	Let the prefix sum array be P. 
•	P[0] = arr[0] 
•	P[i] = P[i-1] + arr[i] for 𝑖 ≥ 1. 
•	The first line of input consists of an integer 𝑁 representing the number of hours. 
